Deployment 
Manual 
Automatic Using github actions
Push the source code to github  , Launch EC2 , install git in server , do Git pull and run the saas using ReadMe File 
Before that create new Github repo and push the source code to github 
Launch the ubuntu server in the aws 
Note the public IP and private key
For automatic Deployment 
Create a folder called .github in main folder 
Create folder called Workflow 
Create file called deploy.yml 
Add the public and private key to github secret 
In your GitHub repository, navigate to:
Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret




